scriba (1.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sync with upstream 1.1.2: the pipeline diagram is redrawn as a dark card in
    a monospace face with neon-green edges, its labels shortened so the text
    stays legible at a README's column width, and the README shows the logo at
    96px and the diagram at full width. No library code changed.

